Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时正是一八九一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}The year was 1891.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.92,0:00:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧洲的局势阴云密布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm clouds were brewing over Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,法德两国成剑拔弩张之势\N{\fnArial\fs30}France and Germany were at each other's throats…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,都由那一系列的爆炸案引起\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the result of a series of bombings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.14,0:00:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说是民族主义者的作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some said it was Nationalists…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.02,0:00:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有说是无政府主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}…others, the anarchists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我的朋友 夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as usual…my friend Sherlock Holmes …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.47,0:01:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的理论依旧与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}…had a different theory entirely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特拉斯堡发生爆炸 号外号外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bombing in Strasbourg! Read all about it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.37,0:01:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.05,0:01:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,无政府主义者涉嫌斯特拉斯堡爆炸案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anarchists suspected…in Strasbourg bombing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候开始当邮递员了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you start working for the postal service?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人是你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was you back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.35,0:02:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,破案破到这个地步还真倒楣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame your activities have landed you in the gutter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,包裹很可疑 敢问收件人是哪位\N{\fnArial\fs30}A curious parcel.Who's the intended recipient?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如等晚上吃饭时候再聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we discuss that over dinner tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,午饭我有空\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm free for lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我没空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨沃伊餐厅怎么样 晚上八点\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about the Savoy, 8:00?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.69,0:02:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,正合我意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候你会现出原形吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And will you be coming as yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.85,0:02:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most likely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三个人跟踪了我们半英里路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three men have been following you for the last half mile…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们动机相当不单纯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…their motives highly unsavory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 他们不是在追我 而是在护送我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, by the way, they're not pursuing me, they're escorting me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且好像不止三个人 应该有四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And instead of three, there seems to be, uh, four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要小心轻放 艾琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady hands with that, Irene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.89,0:03:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在需要小心的人应该不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't think it's my hands you have to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在脸上下重手 我们晚上还有约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful with the face, boys. We do have a dinner date tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.34,0:03:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,餐前面包少吃点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fill up on bread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.89,0:03:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面我忘记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's coming back now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有条子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peelers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在开拍三十四号藏品\N{\fnArial\fs30}We now come to Lot 34…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一尊雕饰异常华丽的埃及石棺\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Egyptian sarcophagus of outstanding provenance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,发掘自国王峡谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}…retrieved from the Valley of the Kings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.23,0:05:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的报酬 大夫 他说非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your payment, doctor. He sends his thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁愿意出价一百英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will bid 100 pounds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hundred. Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,请转交给他 他等着要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, give this to him. He's expecting it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说那位朋友以为我把信给他姐姐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him our friend thinks I delivered it to his sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Stay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我看一下东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…while I check the contents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说全部报酬都在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was assured full payment would be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:05:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.79,0:06:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他又是谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but assured by whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有见过他本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever met him in person?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.84,0:06:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是像我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or like me, have you been…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 别动 千万别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it, hold it. Please, don't move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据尺寸和重量来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judging from size and weight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.89,0:06:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是你想要的报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not the payment you were expecting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.13,0:06:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我看这东西应该会相当劲爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd wager the contents are rather more incendiary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.05,0:06:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.09,0:06:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 告诉过你不要动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear. I told you not to move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.86,0:06:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来备用引爆器被激活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems a secondary charge has been activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女 我处理包裹的时候可能要你协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet thing, I might need your help in the disposal of this parcel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.43,0:06:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千六百英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thousand six hundred, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千七百英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}1700￡, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.96,0:06:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千八百英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}1800￡.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千九百英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}1900￡.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.32,0:06:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百万英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}One million pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.08,0:06:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 还有 着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and by the way, fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.61,0:06:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是逃走 一小时内必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave my side, you'll be dead in an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得晚饭不要迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't be late for dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了这种状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}My schedule will be quite tight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接下来的行程会排得很满的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of these activities here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:07:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子从不迟到 只会提前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been late in my life, only early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.63,0:07:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有品味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fashionably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常狡猾 就算逃跑也那么自信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very witty. So confident, even in retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.47,0:07:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我来保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'II hold onto that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.67,0:07:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等喝开胃酒的时候再一起看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll read it together over an aperitif.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 边吃边看好戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Dinner and a show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着 相信我 我是靠这个吃饭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay. Trust me. This is what I do for a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.57,0:07:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫尔·霍芬斯塔 你真的很走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herr Hoffmanstahl, you should count yourself lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你替他办事的这神秘人物不是普通罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This faceless man with whom you find yourself in business is no ordinary criminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.66,0:07:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个犯罪之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the Napoleon of crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是 你现在有我这个盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately, you now have me as an ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.47,0:07:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个小有名气的私家侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a consulting detective of some repute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你听说过我 我的名字叫福尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you've heard of me? My name is Sherlock…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.89,0:08:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我换一杯茶 谢谢 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fresh pot of tea. Thank you, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 艾德勒小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Miss Adler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,选得不错 这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine choice, this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,信带来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have the letter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.79,0:08:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走了 那真是太不幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taken? Now, that is unfortunate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你包裹惹出来的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}During the chaos created by your package.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.01,0:09:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该早点告诉我你的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps if you had shared your plans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.53,0:09:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要知道我的计划 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish to know my plans now, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在怀疑我会对你不利 艾德勒小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you imagine, Miss Adler, that something would happen to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.30,0:09:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才会把见面地点选在公共场合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you chose to meet here in a public place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最喜欢的餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your favorite restaurant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I blame myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就发现你没办法 控制住对他的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been apparent to me for some time that you had succumbed to your feelings for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不是福尔摩斯 第一次给我带来不便了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this isn't the first occasion Mr. Holmes has inconvenienced me in recent months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该如何去应对\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what to do about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.42,0:10:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这是我自己的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's my problem to solve now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再需要你的协助了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I no longer require your services.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:23.94,Title,0,0,0,0,,《大侦探福尔摩斯2：诡影游戏》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:11:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.79,0:12:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森夫人在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.83,0:12:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯 在家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, you in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家篱笆该修剪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hedge needs trimming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.69,0:12:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜我在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你在哪儿 准备好出门就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care where you are as long as you're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.70,0:12:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想玩捉迷藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna play this game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.87,0:12:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗 我得赶上末班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, I have to catch the last…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,车\N{\fnArial\fs30}…train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's you dead, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我输了 游戏结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lose. Game over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.77,0:12:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没找到我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still don't see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是意外啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿成这样 我是不会和你出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going out with you dressed like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.91,0:13:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不我和你一样穿上老掉牙的军外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you prefer I joined you in the fashion faux pas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.24,0:13:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,围上一条恶心的手工围巾怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of wearing fine military dress with that heinous handmade scarf…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然是你未婚妻的早期作品吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…clearly one of your fianc'searly efforts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.01,0:13:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想死你了 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, how I've missed you, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.77,0:13:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.61,0:13:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎没有注意到你走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've barely noticed your absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.61,0:13:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直专注于研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then again, I'm knee-deep in research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,从羊的肾上腺中提取液体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extracting fluids from the adrenal glands of sheep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,设计我专用的都市迷彩服\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and designing my own urban camouflage…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时步步逼近 我整个侦探生涯中\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all the while verging on a decisive breakthrough…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.19,0:13:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的案子的决定性突破点\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the single most important case of my career, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.67,0:13:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许将永载史册\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps of all time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.67,0:13:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森夫人 你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Hudson, how are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你很高兴 大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. I'm so pleased to see you, doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for inviting me tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很感谢你对爱犬的照料\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thank you for looking after Gladstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:14:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的热情过度的管家夫人 能说句话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear, dear sickly-sweet Nanny, might I have a word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.21,0:14:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yummy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.69,0:14:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去喂蛇吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feed the snake, woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去喂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,妇人之仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touchy, touchy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大夫 你必须送他去疗养院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, you must get him to a sanatorium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.55,0:14:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最近不是咖啡 烟草 就是可可汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been on a diet of coffee, tobacco, and coca leaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never sleeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.23,0:14:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,整天南腔北调的就像在排练话剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear multiple voices as if he's rehearsing a play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会处理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是该给山羊吃打虫药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you have a goat that needs worming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你提醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, how kind of you to remind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.61,0:14:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much to look forward to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.81,0:14:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了你我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would I do without you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你的病人顺利康复 大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with your patient, doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天就结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting married tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥抱一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Embrace me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,华生要结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson's getting married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.63,0:14:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你掉了几斤肉嘛 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've lost a few pounds, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.15,0:14:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 都到你身上去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and you've picked them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定没少吃玛丽的松饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noshing on Mary's muffins, no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:14:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒两杯白兰地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pour us a brandy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.20,0:15:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,单身派对现在开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stag party has begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们最后的冒险 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is our last adventure, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.89,0:15:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定不会浪费的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to make the most of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我以前的办公室也没浪费\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you've made good use of my old office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢我的蜘蛛网吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like my spider's web?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么叫这名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you call it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.47,0:15:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看那条线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow that strand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.11,0:15:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,与印度棉花大亨有关的丑闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do a scandal involving an Indian cotton tycoon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国鸦片商人吸毒过量身亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the overdose of a Chinese opium trader…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特拉斯堡和维也纳爆炸案\N{\fnArial\fs30}…bombings in Strasbourg and Vienna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及美国钢铁巨头之死\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the death of a steel magnate in America{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有什么共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}all have in common?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.45,0:15:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据你的立体模型来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, according to your diorama, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是詹姆斯·莫里亚蒂教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor James Moriarty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.42,0:15:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,数学天才 著名作家和演讲家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mathematical genius. Celebrated author and lecturer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.83,0:15:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑桥时代是拳击冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boxing champion at Cambridge…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.63,0:15:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时也与现任首相成了好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where he made friends with our current prime minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.51,0:16:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么证据来支持你的观点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any evidence to substantiate your claim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:05.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（炸弹危机化解 拍卖行逃过一劫）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍芬斯塔医生之死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hoffmanstahl's death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我听你提过他 盛赞他的医德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.I've heard you speak of him, extolling his virtues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.33,0:16:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍芬斯塔是医学创新前沿的开拓者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoffmanstahl was at the forefront of medical innovations, a true pioneer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在前不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the other day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我化解了一起针对他的炸弹袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I averted an explosion that was intended for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.18,0:16:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里说他死于心脏病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says here he died of a heart attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的谆谆教诲都白费了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has all my instruction been for naught?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.59,0:16:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在看官方报导而且居然会相信它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read the official statement and believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.91,0:16:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是较量 老伙计 暗中的较量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a game, dear man, a shadowy game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授和我就像是猫和老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're playing cat and mouse, the professor and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,斗篷和匕首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cloak and dagger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不是蜘蛛和苍蝇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was spider and fly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:40.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（甲醛）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.96,0:16:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不是苍蝇 我是猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a fly, I'm a cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是老鼠 是匕首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a mouse, but a dagger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.45,0:16:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝的是尸体防腐液\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're drinking embalming fluid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.81,0:16:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 来一杯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Yes. Care for a drop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.49,0:16:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do seem…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兴奋 - 疯癫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excited? - Manic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我承认 - 几乎近于\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am. - Verging on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 神经质 - 神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ecstatic? - Psychotic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.98,0:16:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真该给你带点镇定剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've brought a sedative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拼上性命也要扳倒他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'II give my life to see his demise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要在他的邪恶阴谋得逞之前阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be stopped before his evil machinations come to a crescendo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么实施阴谋呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how will he do all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么无知 坏人就是做得出坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a dingy bird. Bad people do bad things because they can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论受害者 警察还是政府 没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one, not the victims, the police, the governments, not anyone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 除了大侦探福尔摩斯 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Except the great Sherlock Holmes… - Correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以这种状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on this diet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能破解迷局\N{\fnArial\fs30}will work it all out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.77,0:17:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,八九不离十\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or thereabouts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.69,0:17:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,八九左右 还没到十\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thereabouts, not quite there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.89,0:17:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你身体健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's to your good health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,无知的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dingy bird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又对格莱斯顿做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done to Gladstone now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是蓖麻 它的果实有剧毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ricinus communis. The fruit is highly toxic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.47,0:17:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它快停止呼吸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's barely breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.35,0:17:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真个绝妙的时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an excellent opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西应该有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may be just the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不介意我试验一下肾上腺提取物吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, do you mind terribly if I try my adrenal extract?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家的狗到底要死几次你才开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times are you going to kill my dog, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.69,0:17:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑得像出笼的猴子一样快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took off like a monkey from a box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定我等一下会用到这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may need one of those in a few hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当作是结婚礼物吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it a wedding gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,华生 我们从另一个门出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, might we use an alternative exit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的样子有变过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something different about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.31,0:18:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被人盯梢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm under observation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是该看住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.47,0:18:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算整个晚上都带着胡子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will your beard be with us all night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等过了特拉法加广场我就摘下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'II remove it once we're south of Trafalgar Square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.65,0:18:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果莫里亚蒂的人在跟踪你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you believe Moriarty has you under observation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样子是不是太显眼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…isn't this a bit conspicuous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.22,0:18:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,高调到极致 就是隐蔽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so overt, it's covert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,特拉法加广场 你应该安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trafalgar Square. You must be safe by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你这么忧虑地看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you looking at me with such concern?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.04,0:18:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so very worried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的生命力都快干涸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your vitality's been drained from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.93,0:19:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚姻是坟墓 我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage is the end, I tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.09,0:19:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为是个新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think of it as the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armageddon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,重获新生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebirth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.21,0:19:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种束缚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restriction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.01,0:19:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个归宿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Structure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.77,0:19:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听女人的使唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answering to a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,经营一段感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being in a relationship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.34,0:19:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和谐美满的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}A life in matrimony, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有共享天伦之乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}the possibility of a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.30,0:19:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁愿意孤独终老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to die alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.11,0:19:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们今天按照惯例彻夜狂欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have a good old-fashioned romp tonight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.87,0:19:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你去结婚生子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you'l settle down, have a family, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我孤独终老\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'II die alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.27,0:19:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想孤独终老至少也胜过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it's better for one to die alone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辈子活在人间地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}than to live life in eternal purgatory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.09,0:19:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来这种机器会遍布欧洲的大街小巷\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the future, there'll be one of those machines in every town in Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.99,0:19:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,又在柴房里游荡了 是吗 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loitering in the woodshed again, are we, Myccie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 歇利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Sherly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.87,0:19:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.03,0:19:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你的修鞋匠病了 亲爱的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see your bootmaker is ill, dear brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:19:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发觉你换了一个牌子的肥皂来刮胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I detect that you've recently changed the brand of soap with which you shave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说你贝克街前厅的烟囱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chimney in the front room at Baker Street…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的应该再好好打理一下才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}…still needs a damn good sweeping up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.65,0:20:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否发现来时坐的马车有个轮子坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you aware that the hackney carriage by which you arrived had a damaged wheel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.57,0:20:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 左轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.89,0:20:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且再笨的人也能猜到你最近给小提琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's plain to the meanest intelligence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.94,0:20:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,买了把新琴弓\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that you have recently acquired a new bow for your violin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.34,0:20:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,老琴弓 新琴弦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same bow, new strings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.98,0:20:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没猜错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And may I deduce, Mycroft…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.18,0:20:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克罗夫特 晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.43,0:20:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,免了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.67,0:20:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不握手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我之见像你这样一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I deduce that you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是在家就是在第欧根尼俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}who rarely strays from the path that runs from your home to the Diogenes Club{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.40,0:20:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且从不错过每星期一小锅炒虾的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and never on a Monday when they serve your favorite potted shrimps…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,来此必有比参加单身派对更重要的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}…must be here for some far more important reason than my stag party?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他根本就不是你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he's nothing like as slow-witted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.13,0:20:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种智力低下的笨蛋 歇利\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you'd been leading me to believe, Sherly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得很对 华生大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're quite right, Dr. Watson…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.06,0:20:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼下的欧洲暗流涌动 局势随时都可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but with all the conflict in Europe at the moment, the whole situation could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让一让\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一触即发\N{\fnArial\fs30}suddenly erupt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.91,0:20:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里是要阻止一场大灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am here to avoid a dire catastrophe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.99,0:21:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,某两个国家关系很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the concerns of two nations…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能透露它们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which shall remain nameless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们分别说的是法语和德语\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I can tell you they speak French and German…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚若调解不好 我就不得不去瑞士\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are not dealt with tonight, I shall be forced to go to Switzerland…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.17,0:21:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加在莱辛巴赫举行的和平峰会\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to attend the ghastly peace summit in Reichenbach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.49,0:21:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞士最讨厌的就是海拔太高\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst thing about Switzerland is the altitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.18,0:21:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,又让我流鼻血又加重我的哮喘\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gives me nosebleeds, exacerbates my asthma…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你邀请了你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad you invited your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks promising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要喝点什么 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your poison of choice, gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.09,0:21:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,先从香槟开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well start with the champagne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.37,0:21:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能还要几把椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may need several more chairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.89,0:21:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我来一支雪茄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps a good cigar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.69,0:21:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有椅子就不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't bother with the chairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.70,0:21:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥究竟是干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it your brother does exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.62,0:21:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个给国家管管杂物的小干部\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the keeper of the broom cupboard of state.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.90,0:22:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没野心 没激情 但我一直听人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No ambition, no energy yet I'm repeatedly told that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.91,0:22:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国政府好像没了他不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's indispensable to the British government…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.51,0:22:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是外交部\N{\fnArial\fs30}…particularly the Foreign Office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.27,0:22:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来敬你一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to propose a toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.27,0:22:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.00,0:22:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬我的好友 医生 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}To my dear friend, Dr. John…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.24,0:22:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈密什 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…um, Hamish Watson…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.13,0:22:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.97,0:22:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这婚礼的前夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on the eve of his wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.65,0:22:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.65,0:22:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我最好的伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has been the best companion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.21,0:22:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再等等吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't we be waiting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.54,0:22:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在橄榄球队的兄弟们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the boys from my rugby club?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has always kept us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They couldn't attend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.98,0:22:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚踏实地去生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}…flat-footed on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.94,0:22:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没空吗 那我在医学院的那些同学呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}AII of them? Hmm. The chaps from my medical school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.39,0:22:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫了 他们不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They declined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那军队里的战友呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lads from the regiment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.39,0:22:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人比他更加\N{\fnArial\fs30}No man's better{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.55,0:22:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你到底在找谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it you're looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.35,0:22:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得你去结交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worth having at your side…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.75,0:22:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这里我一个认识的人都没有 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't know a single damn person here, do I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.68,0:22:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么激动干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need for hysterics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.04,0:22:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识我 认识迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me and Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么饥渴 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a ponce, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.24,0:22:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,饥渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ponce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.09,0:22:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全忘了我的单身派对 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You completely forgot about my stag party, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.57,0:22:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.45,0:22:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你身体健康 大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your very good health, doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.30,0:23:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾你的朋友们都没来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame none of your friends could make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.43,0:23:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要过去玩上几把\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to the gaming tables.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能接受今晚就这么给毁了 把钱给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I refuse for this night to be a total loss.Give me my money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.99,0:23:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.99,0:23:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把结婚戒指给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the wedding ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.80,0:23:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么想起来自己是伴郎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you're interested in being the best man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指确实应该由你保管没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to keep the ring anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.96,0:23:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,组织单身派对也应该是你的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as you're supposed to organize my stag party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.28,0:23:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是担心你把戒指赔进去 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't want to lose it on a bet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.01,0:23:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有邀请我的朋友们 我有不少朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And invite my friends …of which, by the way, there are many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.77,0:23:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有朋友的人是你 孤僻怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one with no friends…Sherly No Mates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.26,0:23:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人真自以为是 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all "me, me, me, " isn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.24,0:23:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I win!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.57,0:24:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.21,0:24:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钱放在桌上我们就开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your money on the table and we will begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.10,0:24:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 我是西姆萨夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome. I am Madam Simza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.31,0:24:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,牌能洞悉你的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cards can illuminate your past…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.72,0:24:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看清你的现状 揭示你的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…clarify your present, and show you the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.04,0:24:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想问什么问题 请在心中默念\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have a specific question, hold it in your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.06,0:24:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在默念\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm holding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.66,0:24:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know when you're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.51,0:24:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我是想要算算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I'd prefer to read…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.47,0:24:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.20,0:24:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,节制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temperance inverted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.00,0:24:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,逆位意味着反覆无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indicative of volatility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.84,0:25:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女人最近整天借酒浇愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman who has recently taken her comfort in drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.13,0:25:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在寻求什么慰藉 又在逃避什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what does she seek solace? What does she not wish to see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.13,0:25:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个自以为是的傻瓜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fool embarrassing himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.54,0:25:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.34,0:25:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.98,0:25:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,某人误入歧途 身陷自己也不了解的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has been led astray, involved in something without their knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.35,0:25:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.51,0:25:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不足以让我信服\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to make me believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.27,0:25:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,再拿点诚意出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to see it in your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.95,0:25:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我还能做得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I can do better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.12,0:25:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣杯之二 象征坚韧的纽带\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Two of Cups, a powerful bond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.80,0:25:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,联系谁呢 也许是姐姐和弟弟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But between whom? A brother and sister perhaps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.44,0:25:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看到一个名字 没错 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I see a name. Yes, it's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.65,0:25:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,芮内\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Rene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.25,0:25:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.25,0:25:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一张恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.30,0:25:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在玩什么花样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we playing this game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.64,0:26:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里得来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.84,0:26:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从拍卖行一个女人那里偷来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole it from a woman in an auction room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我相信它是寄给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I believe it was intended for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.45,0:26:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的西姆
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.77,0:26:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我的脸 因为你再也见不到它了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.17,0:26:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有付出这样的代价
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.38,0:26:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能改变历史的进程
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.66,0:26:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于找到我人生的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.06,0:26:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到我人生的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Found my purpose in life."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.46,0:26:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我一直想问的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the question I've been holding is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.67,0:26:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,芮内人生的意义是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what purpose is Rene fulfilling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.76,0:26:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time is up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.93,0:26:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有别的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have other clients.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.54,0:26:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我猜你可能还没发现我右肩上方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though you may not have detected the wisp of astrakhan fur…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.42,0:26:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,木钉上挂着一缕俄国羊毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}…snagged on a nail over my left shoulder…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.74,0:26:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你一定不会没有闻到\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you couldn't have failed to notice the overpowering aroma…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.46,0:26:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,腌鲱鱼和伏特加的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of herring pickled in vodka…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.07,0:26:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及那股浓重刺鼻的体味\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in tandem with a truly unfortunate body odor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.31,0:27:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们头顶的房梁上躲着个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a man concealed in the rafters above us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.72,0:27:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥萨克人 他们的运动能力举世闻名\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Cossack, renowned for their infeasible acrobatic abilities…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.96,0:27:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样出名的还有他们夜间的刺杀活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and are notorious for moonlighting as assassins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.96,0:27:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此可以肯定你的下一个客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's safe to presume that your next client{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.49,0:27:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是来杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is here to kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.33,0:27:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想算什么吗 没了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else? No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.46,0:27:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 掏翻鸟窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, pillage the nest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.19,0:27:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,剪掉翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clip wings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.71,0:27:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 猛击鸟嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now blunt his beak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.84,0:27:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,敲碎鸟蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crack eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.36,0:27:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,混匀 适量加盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scramble. Pinch of salt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.53,0:27:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡椒少许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch of pepper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.62,0:27:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把煎蛋翻一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flip the omelet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.63,0:28:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上必要的调味料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Additional seasoning required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.59,0:28:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,早饭做好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breakfast is served.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.73,0:28:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 你可不能死 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me. I need you alive. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.82,0:29:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一招你没算到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't see that in the cards, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.89,0:29:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming down, folks, coming down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.01,0:30:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子我们又能再赌上一局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we've got ourselves our next cockfight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.54,0:30:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四 三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, four, three, two, one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.50,0:30:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let him go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.53,0:30:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,追上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.11,0:30:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}AII mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.14,0:31:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.30,0:31:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 他确实很臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. He did stink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.62,0:31:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你再跑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you can run…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.74,0:31:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.43,0:31:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚打了一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just had a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.48,0:32:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚打了一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just had a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.28,0:32:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.12,0:32:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪儿了？- 很高兴见到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where were you? - I'm glad to see…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.92,0:32:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你这个伴郎如此尽责我非常欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're taking your best-man duties so seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.16,0:32:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我寡不敌众\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on my own!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.76,0:32:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的钱都要不回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna get my monies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.33,0:32:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还咬我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was biting my leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.13,0:32:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让卡罗瑟去给你们的汽车加点燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'II have Carruthers put some fuel into that motor carriage of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.69,0:32:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还有婚礼要参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do have a wedding to attend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.82,0:32:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'II drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.82,0:32:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘀嘀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ho-honk. Ha-ha-ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.70,0:32:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再喝一杯嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have another drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.23,0:32:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我想你已经喝得够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I think you've had quite enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.59,0:35:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也来这里参加过婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been to a wedding here before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.20,0:35:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funeral too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.40,0:35:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授想见见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The professor wants to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.56,0:35:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到最近发生的事情 他早该来找我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd expected to hear from him sooner, in light of recent events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.17,0:35:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想知道今天下午你可否去大学跑一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was wondering if it'd be convenient for you to come by the college this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.26,0:35:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的课四点结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}His lecture concludes at 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.62,0:35:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.58,0:35:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让一让 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}One side, chummy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.45,0:35:56.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《渔夫之歌》 舒伯特 一八二六年\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fischerweise, " Schubert, 1826.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.23,0:36:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃你那些愚蠢的伎俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Give up your foolish trickery."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.39,0:36:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条鱼不受欺骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This fish you cannot cheat."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.55,0:36:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我没打扰你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I'm not intruding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.12,0:36:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等片刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.24,0:36:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,马修 把这些带去交给威廉姆斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matthew, take these up to Mr. Williams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.92,0:36:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他记得带上我的白色领带和燕尾服\N{\fnArial\fs30}And make sure he packs my white tie and tails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.24,0:36:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'II take care of it, professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.20,0:36:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.96,0:36:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 我就要开始巡回演讲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do apologize.I'm off on a blasted lecture tour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.69,0:36:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想喝茶还是咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you care for some tea or coffee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.25,0:36:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.37,0:36:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那来点烈性饮料吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something stronger, perhaps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.69,0:36:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 但是能否麻烦您给我签个名\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but might I trouble you for an inscription?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.14,0:36:34.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小行星动力学及课堂笔记 詹姆斯·莫里亚蒂教授 著）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.68,0:36:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说那位好大夫今天结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read that the good doctor was to be married today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.28,0:36:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚礼怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was the service?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.89,0:36:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,圆满完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.33,0:36:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不再是我的侦查伙伴 没有半点干系\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll no longer be party to my investigations. He's out of the equation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.14,0:37:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点相信你一定会充分考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you'll take this into consideration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.46,0:37:06.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（室内园艺的艺术）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.78,0:37:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你有没有为我考虑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what considerations will you grant me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.88,0:37:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认真看过这本书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you actually read the book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.48,0:37:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得很有说服力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it compelling…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.88,0:37:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我主要的兴趣还是你最近的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}…though I'm primarily interested in your more recent endeavors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.09,0:37:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢你的赞美\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take that as a compliment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.05,0:37:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的才华也相当敬佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the utmost regard for your talents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.90,0:37:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很荣幸终于能和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pleasure to finally meet you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.22,0:37:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,正式见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…officially.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.07,0:37:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知你对笔迹学有没有研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you familiar with the study of graphology?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.47,0:37:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没有太在意这个方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never given it any serious thought, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.27,0:37:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对书写笔迹的心理分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}The psychological analysis of handwriting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.12,0:37:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你上半部分的Ｐ和Ｊ和Ｍ\N{\fnArial\fs30}The upward strokes on the P, the J, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.72,0:37:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以看出智慧高人一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the M indicate a genius-level intellect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.32,0:38:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而下半部分的华丽笔法则说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}While the flourishes on the lower zone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.37,0:38:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你富于创造又非常严谨的天性\N{\fnArial\fs30}…denote a highly creative yet meticulous nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.49,0:38:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果把字体倾斜 和运笔的力度结合起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if one observes the overall slant and the pressure of the writing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.98,0:38:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以看出你这个人极度自恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there's a suggestion of acute narcissism, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.82,0:38:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全丧失同情心\N{\fnArial\fs30}a complete lack of empathy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.86,0:38:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且严重倾向于\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and a pronounced inclination toward…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.50,0:38:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.30,0:38:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,道德沦丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…moral insanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.99,0:38:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你之前提到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In answer to your previous request{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.83,0:38:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,华生大夫与此事无关的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}regarding Dr. Watson not being involved…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.07,0:38:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的回答是 错\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the answer is no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.36,0:38:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天体运动的法则告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The laws of celestial mechanics dictate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.56,0:38:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当两个物体碰撞时\N{\fnArial\fs30}that when two objects collide…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.53,0:38:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会有些影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there is always damage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.73,0:38:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,波及到周边\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a collateral nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.37,0:38:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,举例来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exempli gratia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.90,0:38:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位男士 意见不合势同水火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two gentlemen find themselves at cross-purposes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.62,0:38:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻的女士 挣扎于两人之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young woman torn between them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.39,0:38:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这压力令她难以承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}The strain proves too much for her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.19,0:38:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她突然之间病倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she suddenly falls ill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.55,0:38:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果以悲剧收场\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with tragic consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.80,0:39:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种罕见的结核病例\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rare form of tuberculosis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.33,0:39:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,短短数秒就夺去了她的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}She succumbed in a matter of seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.01,0:39:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.18,0:39:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定要下这局棋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are you sure you want to play this game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.46,0:39:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你会输\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you'd lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.79,0:39:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心 如果你想置我于死地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest assured, if you attempt to bring destruction down upon me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.96,0:39:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会心慈手软\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I shall do the same to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.64,0:39:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的敬重 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My respect for you, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.84,0:39:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你活到现在的唯一原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the only reason you're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.13,0:39:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的好话说了不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've paid me several compliments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.97,0:39:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有一言相告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me pay you one in return…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.93,0:39:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我想要的结果可以达到的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when I say that if I were assured of the former eventuality…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.06,0:39:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意付出任何代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I would cheerfully accept the latter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.19,0:40:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会向那对新人致以诚挚的问候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'II be sure to send my regards to the happy couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.88,0:40:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,改日再聚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another time, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.06,0:40:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备发车去布莱顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}AII aboard for Brighton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.43,0:40:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备发车\N{\fnArial\fs30}AII aboard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.95,0:40:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个车厢来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which coach are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.27,0:40:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be just here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.27,0:40:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一等车厢\N{\fnArial\fs30}First class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.36,0:40:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,去布莱顿的列车即将发车\N{\fnArial\fs30}AII aboard for Brighton! AII aboard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.52,0:40:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车 华生大夫 你的妻子需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, Dr. Watson, your wife needs you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.89,0:40:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就来 华生太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming, Mrs. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.85,0:40:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一等车厢和香槟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. First class, champagne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.22,0:40:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真会讨女孩子欢心 华生先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know how to spoil a girl, Mr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.98,0:40:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不是普通女孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not just any girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.66,0:41:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.34,0:41:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,火车靠站期间不能使用洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't use the lavatory while the train's in the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.19,0:41:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是华生太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Mrs. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.52,0:41:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把瓶子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that bottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.52,0:41:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界上除了你身边 我哪里也不想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, there is nowhere else in the world I would rather be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.36,0:41:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也只愿你一人陪在身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one I'd rather be with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.32,0:41:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你背后裤腰上会插着把枪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have a gun stuffed down the back of your trousers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.17,0:41:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,积习难改\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh. Old habits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.97,0:41:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahem. Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.82,0:41:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.90,0:41:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't order that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.06,0:41:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们附赠的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}With our compliments, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.18,0:41:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 放那里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Put it there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.88,0:42:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开车门 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.57,0:42:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你可以出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time for you to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.14,0:42:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.85,0:42:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这不算是我最好的伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree it's not my best disguise, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.33,0:42:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也只能凑合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I had to make do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.38,0:42:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.78,0:42:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.82,0:42:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 快关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, shut the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.02,0:42:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们隔着门也会开枪的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theyl only shoot through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.18,0:42:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.06,0:42:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.59,0:43:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很理解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.19,0:43:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.07,0:43:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实造成很多不便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terribly inconvenient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.23,0:43:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.20,0:43:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们大概有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many are we expecting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.41,0:43:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,六七个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half a dozen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.29,0:43:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.17,0:43:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂送你的结婚礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wedding present from Moriarty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.69,0:43:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 婚礼很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely ceremony, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.97,0:43:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家流下了喜悦的泪水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many a tear shed in joy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.37,0:43:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.14,0:43:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等片刻 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just a minute, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.70,0:43:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you trust me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.10,0:43:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.30,0:43:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然如此我就得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I shall have to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.46,0:43:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有所表现才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}do something about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.99,0:43:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想下一个受死 你们这群畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's up to bat next, you bastards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.92,0:43:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,派点像样的人过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send out the fast bowler!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.32,0:43:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 把门关上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, do shut the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.45,0:43:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had to be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.97,0:43:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's safe now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.66,0:44:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先听我说 我时机掌握得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my own defense, I timed it perfectly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.66,0:44:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀死了我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you kill my wife?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.82,0:44:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然杀死了我的新婚妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just kill my new wife?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.55,0:44:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.23,0:44:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 你刚把她扔下火车怎么会没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? How do you know that when you just threw her off a train?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.64,0:44:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 时机掌握得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I timed it perfectly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.16,0:44:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.65,0:44:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.53,0:44:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.73,0:44:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我解释清楚我们也都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time I've explained, we'd both be dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.87,0:44:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉夫人 火车靠站期间不能使用洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, madam. You can't use the lavatory while the train's in the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.43,0:44:47.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（有人）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.58,0:45:06.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（磷 高度易燃）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.94,0:45:08.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（空闲）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.33,0:45:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was no accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.90,0:45:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我设计好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was by design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.90,0:45:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.43,0:45:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要听我详细说明\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you need me to elaborate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.71,0:45:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我们先干正经事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or can we just crack on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.08,0:45:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.13,0:46:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 老伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, old boy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.73,0:46:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在很安全 正和我哥哥在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's as safe as houses.She's with my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.45,0:46:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在度蜜月\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my honeymoon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.50,0:46:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么引他们过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you lead them here?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.42,0:46:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要牵连我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you involve us?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.50,0:46:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是冲我来的而是冲你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They aren't here for me! They're here for you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.19,0:46:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.96,0:46:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so am I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.56,0:46:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心开门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now mind the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.57,0:46:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.21,0:46:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们会觉得二等车厢更加舒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll find that second class is more comfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.62,0:46:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,道路很畅通\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coast is clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.98,0:46:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点去 跑起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the south, quick march.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.59,0:46:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪我躺一会儿 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie down with me, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.07,0:46:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.75,0:47:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我执意如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I insist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.68,0:47:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们躺下来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.37,0:47:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在等待 而我在抽烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are waiting. I am smoking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.47,0:47:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心地等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patiently waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.80,0:47:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.28,0:47:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你反击的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your window of opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.29,0:47:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要失手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.14,0:47:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你不要失手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said make it count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.30,0:47:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给你创造几个机会才够呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many windows must I provide?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.29,0:48:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会想到去布莱顿度蜜月会如此凶险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd have known that honeymooning in Brighton was such a dangerous notion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.02,0:48:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是这个原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what this is about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.86,0:48:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己也承认 你并不喜欢那地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}By your own admission, you've never enjoyed it there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.38,0:48:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就从来没去过布莱顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been to Brighton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.30,0:48:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你现在吓得想不起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you're just too fragile to remember at present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.95,0:48:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.23,0:48:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我我妻子没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me my wife's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.71,0:48:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我不能同时办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.47,0:48:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定没事 说了 我的时机掌握得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise. As I said, I timed it perfectly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.77,0:48:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这儿来 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here, madam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.29,0:48:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该要祝你新婚快乐 华生太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe congratulations are in order, Mrs. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.62,0:49:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也叫福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the other Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.78,0:49:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说有两个福尔摩斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean there's two of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.63,0:49:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 今天晚上真是精彩极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How marvelous. Could this evening get any better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.19,0:49:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我和玛丽会成为目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were Mary and I targeted at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.95,0:49:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.95,0:49:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有两层原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is twofold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.87,0:49:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他盯上我们都是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's after us because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.88,0:49:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这件事上恐怕你也有一半责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you must bear half the responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.88,0:49:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.36,0:49:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是你和玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had you and Mary…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.16,0:49:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So predictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.84,0:49:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么迫不及待要结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}…not been hell-bent on wedding, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.21,0:49:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这案子早就搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could've solved this case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.17,0:49:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,行行行 都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's my fault now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.57,0:49:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你不得不承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}The argument could be made…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.21,0:49:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.01,0:49:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你婚礼办得实在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your nuptials were poorly timed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.10,0:49:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 我们的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus, our relationship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.50,0:49:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relationship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.26,0:49:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 我们的友谊还没有走到尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well, partnership.has not yet run its course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.51,0:49:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友 如果你能帮我把这个案子了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear fellow, if you could be bothered to see this through to the end…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.07,0:49:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今后再也不来找你帮忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I shall never again ask you to assist me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.96,0:49:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次 下不为例\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once more unto the breach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.77,0:49:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就等你这句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.81,0:49:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 回到正题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, to the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.25,0:50:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,案情复杂得让人欲罢不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so deliciously complicated. You may be asking yourself…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.41,0:50:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会问自己 一个犯罪首脑会想要从\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what does a criminal mastermind want{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.30,0:50:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个吉普赛占卜师那里得到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a simple gypsy fortune teller?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.62,0:50:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是想要她的弟弟 我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her brother, I tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.50,0:50:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们找到这个关键人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we find him, and we must…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.78,0:50:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先找到我的行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you find my luggage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.55,0:50:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.31,0:50:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.19,0:50:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这次要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it we're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.15,0:50:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴黎 全世界最佳的蜜月胜地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris, the most sensible honeymoon destination of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.59,0:50:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么去巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why Paris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.59,0:50:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有桃子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.43,0:50:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个以干果著称的吉普赛人营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside the city at Montreuil…there's a Gypsy camp famous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.44,0:50:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃子尤其出名\N{\fnArial\fs30}for its dried fruit, especially peaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.08,0:50:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那个地方应该能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there we shall find our fortune teller…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.52,0:51:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个占卜师 然后把包还给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and return her bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.30,0:51:45.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莫里亚蒂教授讲座）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.27,0:51:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本书真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.91,0:51:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.56,0:52:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,您真是无与伦比
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.88,0:52:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,过奖了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.66,0:52:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我的票呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my ticket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.23,0:52:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是好书
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.99,0:52:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.31,0:52:29.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（唐璜 巴黎大剧院）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.76,0:52:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 你的票可能用不上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, you won't be needing yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.32,0:52:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可惜了 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a shame, professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.60,0:52:42.61,Title,0,0,0,0,,我一直很想去看《唐璜》\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking forward to Don Giovanni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.19,0:52:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.99,0:52:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.80,0:52:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着迈哈德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow Meinhard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.36,0:53:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 停
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.53,0:53:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒一醒 我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.69,0:53:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好准备 我们就要被调戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brace yourself. We're about to be violated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.97,0:53:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么杞人忧天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so cynical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.14,0:53:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我找 西姆萨
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.54,0:53:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 知道 先生 我知道 她在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.34,0:53:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 她在 在
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.50,0:53:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.83,0:53:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拿走了我的行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're taking my luggage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.19,0:53:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用担心 华生 她的包在我这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laugh them away, Watson. I have her bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.63,0:53:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的包在我这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.35,0:53:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的包也拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had her bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.16,0:54:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在外套也被拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they have my coat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.60,0:54:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,西姆萨夫人在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Madam Simza?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.00,0:54:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,西姆萨夫人在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.69,0:54:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是西姆萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Simza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.18,0:54:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,西姆是只鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sim is a goose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.74,0:54:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是西姆 哈哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Sim. Ha-ha-ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.43,0:54:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,围巾不错 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice scarf. I like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.29,0:54:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,此事有关他的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.82,0:54:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你饿不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hungry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.82,0:54:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,饥饿难耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Famished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.83,0:54:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 这道刺猬肉炖杂菜太美味了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, this is a gloriou shedgehog goulash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.67,0:55:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得有吃过比这更好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't remember ever having had better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.68,0:55:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.36,0:55:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次吃刺猬肉炖杂菜是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when was the last time you had a hedgehog goulash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.68,0:55:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 华生 我不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, Watson, I can't remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.25,0:55:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你只是在压抑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you've repressed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.53,0:55:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你不一样 我从不压抑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where we differ. Unlike you, I repress nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.06,0:55:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,再正常不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfectly normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.46,0:55:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么可以对一个邀请我们进她的帐篷\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you be rude to this woman who has invited us into her tent…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.78,0:55:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,又给我们刺猬吃的女士如此无礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…offered us her hedgehog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.63,0:55:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为把女士推下火车的人你有资格吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says the man who throws women from trains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.94,0:55:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.62,0:55:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,热心的公民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concerned citizens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.19,0:55:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么有人想要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did someone try to kill me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.99,0:55:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟结交了一个非常危险的人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother has become involved with a very dangerous man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.67,0:55:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他确信芮内告诉了 你一些不该透露的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who clearly believes that Rene has told you something you shouldn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.36,0:55:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.17,0:55:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找他找了一年多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking for him for over a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.77,0:55:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我为什么会去伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was why I was in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.25,0:55:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他最后一次出现的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the last place anyone saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.33,0:56:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然你弟弟很爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clear that your brother loves you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.82,0:56:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绝对不会寄一些会对你不利的邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd never send you a message that would put you in harm's way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.14,0:56:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此透漏的信息都是由于疏忽大意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any information, therefore, would be, by 456, unintentional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.26,0:56:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有寄给你其他东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he sent you anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.11,0:56:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有几张画而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few drawings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.07,0:56:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们来看看里面的奥妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just see what they have to tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.20,0:56:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没选用一般的画纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unusual choice of paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.96,0:56:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,比较厚 是印刷厂专用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thicker gauge, designed for a printing press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.41,0:56:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些纸的质地和信纸一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's the same stock as the letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.85,0:56:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来有霉味\N{\fnArial\fs30}They smell musty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.77,0:56:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是存放在阴冷潮湿的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have been stored somewhere cold and damp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.90,0:56:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 血迹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that? Blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.94,0:56:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,红酒 一个靠近印刷厂的红酒酒窖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wine. So a wine cellar located near a printing press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.35,0:56:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,范围缩小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should narrow it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.95,0:56:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他再也不会回去的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.80,0:56:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫绿兔子的无政府组织有个酒窖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a wine cellar used by the anarchist group Lapin Vert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.60,0:56:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,芮内和他们的老大曾很有交情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rene was close to their leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.04,0:56:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳德·哈瓦锡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claude Ravache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.71,0:57:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bomb maker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.95,0:57:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上个星期才见过他的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sampled some of his work last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.51,0:57:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾是那组织的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a part of the movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.07,0:57:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,芮内也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was Rene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.64,0:57:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我们觉得它太极端了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until it became too extreme for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.20,0:57:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈瓦锡认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ravache knows me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.68,0:57:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我弟弟回去了 他会见我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my brother's back there, he will see us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.21,0:57:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这就去问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will send a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.85,0:57:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去约哈瓦锡见面
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.25,0:57:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.06,0:57:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 吉普赛人劝你喝酒你都别喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you do, don't let these gypsies make you drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.43,0:57:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.23,0:57:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳舞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.39,0:57:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上别跳 不然你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, don't dance. It'll be the death of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.76,0:57:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道跳舞是什么下场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what happens when you dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.51,0:58:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 华生太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good morning, Mrs. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.12,0:58:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,早饭吃过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you had breakfast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.32,0:58:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦利做的辣烤羊腰棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stanley here does a wonderful deviled kidney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.33,0:58:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carruthers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.05,0:58:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.17,0:58:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有华生太太的电报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telegram for Mrs. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.42,0:58:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点也看不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.70,0:58:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.39,0:58:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.43,0:58:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最厌恶的玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My most loathed Mary, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.19,0:58:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点也不爱你 再也不想见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not love you. I never wish to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.39,0:58:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开你的每一秒钟都是祝福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every moment I count away from you is a blessing."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.08,0:58:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fret not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.24,0:58:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是双重密码 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a double encryption, my dear…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.16,0:58:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和歇利小时候就开始用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that Sherly and I have used since we were boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.57,0:58:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果信息的第一个字母是个辅音\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the first letter of the message is a consonant…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.49,0:59:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那信息的真实含义就和表述相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then what follows is the mirrored truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.85,0:59:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.94,0:59:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stanley!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.46,0:59:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 尽管我们相处的时间非常短\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, although our time together has been but a brief interlude…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.82,0:59:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我开始理解为什么 有着某些特点的男性\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm beginning to understand how a man of particular disposition…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.19,0:59:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某些特殊情况下 或许是极端情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}…under certain circumstances, extreme ones perhaps…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.36,0:59:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,会变得喜欢身边有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}…might grow to enjoy the company of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.00,0:59:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这样性别的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a person of your gender. Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.89,0:59:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.97,0:59:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过奖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most charming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.53,0:59:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}May… Terribly sorry. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.58,0:59:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里啊 斯坦利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going, Stanley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.18,1:00:03.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（七蛙餐厅）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.31,1:00:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到了 下车吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.23,1:00:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.08,1:00:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来进来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.52,1:00:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还躲在地下室吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still hiding in basements?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.37,1:01:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近这阵子不方便出去
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.62,1:01:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,能见到你我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.94,1:01:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来看你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.95,1:01:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.23,1:01:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想将这一时刻…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.91,1:01:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你的英国朋友分享\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your English friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.16,1:01:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一七八九年 很有意义的年份\N{\fnArial\fs30}1789, a seminal vintage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.84,1:01:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们大革命的一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}The year of our glorious revolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.20,1:01:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.00,1:01:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由战胜暴政的一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}When freedom triumphed over tyranny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.53,1:01:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my brother here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.89,1:01:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久没见过他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen him for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.61,1:01:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.90,1:01:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.62,1:01:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,芮内寄来的信纸和这儿的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A letter was received from Rene using this same paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.91,1:01:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然 他去哪里都随身携带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. He took it with him wherever he went.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.55,1:01:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没骗你 芮内不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's telling the truth. Rene isn't here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.71,1:01:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的任务是去协助一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was given another assignment by an…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.19,1:01:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个不具名的赞助人\N{\fnArial\fs30}An anonymous benefactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.88,1:01:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another Englishman…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.00,1:02:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有钱 有权 支持我们的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with money, power, who supported our cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.57,1:02:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.65,1:02:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全都要听他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he dictates our every move…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.70,1:02:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,却要我为他的恐怖袭击负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}…demanding I take responsibility for his acts of terror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.31,1:02:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和恶魔定了契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a deal with the devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.15,1:02:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但过了今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after tonight, ahem…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.27,1:02:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it will be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.36,1:02:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的任务快完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job is almost done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.52,1:02:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又让你放了个炸弹 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's had you plant another bomb, hasn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.97,1:02:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳德 告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Claude, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.89,1:02:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们俩可以帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.21,1:02:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望他们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish they could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.85,1:02:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, gentlemen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.18,1:02:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老婆和孩子在他手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he has my wife and children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.18,1:02:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你告诉我炸弹在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you tell us where the bomb is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.54,1:02:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想办法救你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'II find a way to help your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.74,1:02:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事不用你操心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's already taken care of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.71,1:02:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都说好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.35,1:02:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.80,1:03:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不留后患\N{\fnArial\fs30}No loose ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.20,1:03:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要保证我家人安全我只有一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one thing I can do to keep my family safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.12,1:03:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只剩不到十分钟时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have less than 10 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.29,1:03:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.45,1:03:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么了 走 去看看 快
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.78,1:03:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那手枪对他没用 不如你拿来掩护楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has no further need of that pistol. Why don't you take it and cover the stairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.07,1:03:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去看看 快
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.67,1:03:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方就一个出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way out of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.67,1:04:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.24,1:04:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别具匠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Ingenious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.60,1:04:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个 我们快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one. Quickly as we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.73,1:04:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道该如何处理那个沙袋 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what to do with that sandbag, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.29,1:04:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.97,1:04:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.30,1:04:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,大夫 请确认一下那个拉杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, could you secure that lever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.75,1:04:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早该告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.67,1:04:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈瓦锡很坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ravache was strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.35,1:04:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为自由而生 不会轻易自杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lived for liberty.He would never take his own life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.63,1:04:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.12,1:04:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟 他很脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother, he's weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.33,1:04:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,西姆 你先深吸一口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sim, I need you to take a deep breath…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.25,1:04:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后跟着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and follow us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.69,1:04:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去大剧院\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the opera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.82,1:07:14.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（商业峰会 迈哈德下榻凯旋门大酒店）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.10,1:07:17.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（凯旋门大酒店）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.80,1:07:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.96,1:07:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.64,1:07:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我犯了个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.56,1:08:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管政治上我们有分歧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.80,1:08:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,商业让我们团结
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.16,1:09:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他选在这个位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took the shot from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.52,1:09:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还用了三脚架和枪托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using a tripod and a shooting stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.65,1:09:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后意识到还有个更好的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}And realized there was a better position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.01,1:09:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这道浅痕说明他把三脚架拖到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a faint scrape where he dragged his tripod and set it up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.98,1:09:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概六百码吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six hundred yards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.06,1:09:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者六百五十码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or 650?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.38,1:09:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提还有时速七 八英里的风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention a seven- or eight-mile-an-hour wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.06,1:09:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还得要个风速计\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would've needed a wind gauge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.39,1:09:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就放在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which he placed here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.43,1:09:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在这里放了根香烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And put a cigarette down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.72,1:09:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么远能打中吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can anyone shoot that far?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.36,1:10:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种人整个欧洲不过五六个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not more than half a dozen men in all of Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.01,1:10:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人有几个参加过阿富汗战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of those men served in Afghanistan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.29,1:10:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.53,1:10:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫什朋加泰克尔的混合烟草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hirschsprung with a touch of Tekel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.45,1:10:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是卷烟的时候掉下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have fallen out when he was rolling up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.29,1:10:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们军队都是抽这种的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't that the blend you all smoked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.50,1:10:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过某个上校的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't I read something about a colonel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.14,1:10:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯汀·莫兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian Moran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.74,1:10:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国陆军的头号神枪手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best marksman in the British army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.11,1:10:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,行为不检革除军籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dishonorable discharge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.31,1:10:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可能当职业杀手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's likely now a gun for hire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.55,1:10:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我遇到的第二个他的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the second victim of his that I've encountered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.24,1:10:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么能更好地掩盖谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What better way to conceal a killing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.80,1:10:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会在爆炸现场去找弹孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one looks for a bullet hole in a bomb blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.06,1:10:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟到了二十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's 20 minutes late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.54,1:10:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must come soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.38,1:10:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身上可没证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.02,1:10:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又是个外国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am a foreigner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.70,1:10:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种局面就是莫里亚蒂最想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This climate is exactly what Moriarty wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.07,1:10:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,香草煎蛋 很好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahem. The omelet fines herbes was divine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.51,1:11:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这儿的茶简直太次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but they spared every expense on the tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.84,1:11:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们是继续抱怨还是先理清思路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now shall we compare moods, or consider what we know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.28,1:11:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天的爆炸显然想让人以为是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night's bombing was clearly meant…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.21,1:11:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国对斯特拉斯堡事件的报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to look like Germany's retaliation for Strasbourg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.33,1:11:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但真正目的是 掩饰一起针对个人的谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, the bomb was also meant to conceal the murder of just one man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.53,1:11:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,被枪杀的男人就是阿尔弗雷德·迈哈德\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man killed by the gunshot was none other than Alfred Meinhard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.30,1:11:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是军火商 重型军火\N{\fnArial\fs30}He makes guns. Big guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.11,1:11:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天前某不明投资人 买了他公司大量股票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only days ago, a large share of his company was bought by an unknown investor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.59,1:11:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫里亚蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moriarty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.75,1:11:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,线索提示了一个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clues point in one direction, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.80,1:11:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为了避免重蹈昨晚的覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to avoid repeating last night's debacle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.56,1:11:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有必要收集够充分的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I was obliged to collect more sufficient data, hence my tardiness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.76,1:11:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我来迟了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.28,1:11:43.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欧洲和平进程受挫）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.93,1:11:45.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（凯旋门大酒店发生爆炸）
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.37,1:11:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开车还有四十分钟 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Train departs in 40 minutes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.72,1:12:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你的外套 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.89,1:12:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿行李就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the bags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.81,1:12:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.65,1:12:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有时间来满足一下我的兴趣爱好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have enough time for me to indulge my little habit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.01,1:12:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.02,1:12:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的兴趣爱好就是去喂那些城里的鸽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}His habit of feeding that urban species, the feral pigeon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.26,1:12:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴黎有七个主干线火车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there are seven mainline railway stations in Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.47,1:12:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但能让他花个十分钟跑去杜乐丽花园\N{\fnArial\fs30}But taking 10 minutes to get to the Jardin des Tuileries…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.75,1:12:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找那群长着翅膀的寄生虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where the largest concentration of the winged vermin may be found…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.44,1:12:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只有一种可能 巴黎北站\N{\fnArial\fs30}…reduces there to one, the Gare du Nord…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.64,1:12:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正好可以赶上 十一点零四分开往柏林的火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where he will be just in time to catch the 11:04 train to Berlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.13,1:12:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这趟车沿路会停几站 其中就有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes several stops along the way, one of which is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.73,1:12:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,海尔布隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heilbronn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.25,1:12:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是我们要去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly where we must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.18,1:13:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈哈德的工厂 就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where Meinhard's factory is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.78,1:13:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是莫里亚蒂的工厂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Moriarty's factory now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.50,1:13:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 由于爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, due to the bombing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.60,1:13:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,法德两国间的通道关闭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the crossing between France and Germany is to be closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.75,1:13:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,本案的追查到此结束 除非我们碰巧遇到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid our pursuit is over unless we can happen upon a comrade…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.27,1:13:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位很熟悉边境地形的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who knows their way around borders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.20,1:13:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,太英国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too English.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.04,1:13:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你确实很像吉普赛人\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, you do make a fantastic gypsy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.49,1:13:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,浑身散发着吉普赛的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly smell like a fantastic gypsy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.73,1:13:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要这么损\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now, no need to be demeaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.69,1:13:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的漂亮围巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a nice scarf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.02,1:13:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 太英国了 比较适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, too English. It'll suit you more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.82,1:13:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.94,1:13:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑马是你的 灰马是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black one is yours. Gray one is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.02,1:13:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这匹马是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.11,1:13:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.39,1:13:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,马车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the wagons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.35,1:13:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,马车太慢了 你不会骑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wagon is too slow.Can't you ride?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.04,1:13:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他不会骑马\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that he can't ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.36,1:13:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it you put it, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.88,1:13:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种动物两头都危险 中间又麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dangerous at both ends and crafty in the middle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.69,1:14:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要一个有自我意识的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I want anything with a mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.37,1:14:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的两腿间上下耸动\N{\fnArial\fs30}of its own bobbing about between my legs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.29,1:14:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就要一辆自行车吧 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I shall require a bicycle, thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.82,1:14:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,都一八九一年了 就该租一个热气球\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 1891. Could've chartered a balloon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.66,1:14:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有简单点的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we make this more manageable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.80,1:14:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,火烧眉毛了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.29,1:14:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国又不会逃走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not as if Germany is going somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.29,1:14:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有另一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.58,1:14:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持不懈才会胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow and steady wins the race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.64,1:15:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.70,1:15:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从卸货码头溜进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We slip in through the loading bay, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.83,1:15:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他的把柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}find out what he's doing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.99,1:15:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后溜出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and we get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.99,1:15:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,溜出来有点难度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting out might be tricky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.67,1:15:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会来接应你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will get you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.51,1:15:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我弟弟在里面 带他活着出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my brother's in there, get him out alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.10,1:16:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you happy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.82,1:16:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.42,1:16:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此时此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this moment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.90,1:16:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是和去布莱顿度蜜月一样开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are you as happy as you would be on your honeymoon in Brighton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.39,1:16:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本懒得去回答这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to grace that question with an answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.80,1:16:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you happy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.60,1:16:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们来这儿是有其他原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're here for another reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.32,1:16:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.00,1:16:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们开始做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we get on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.68,1:16:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不难回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.36,1:16:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是去办正经事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will we do something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.52,1:16:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是在这里等他们转回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or wait for them to come back round?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.84,1:16:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在几点\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.33,1:16:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三点十五分 - 在那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three-fifteen. - Over there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.09,1:16:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个设施的居住区里应该有个电报室\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the residential part of the complex should be a telegraph office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.33,1:16:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个发给迈克罗夫特 整点时回这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send this to Mycroft. Be back here on the hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.79,1:16:47.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迈哈德邮政与电报局）
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.16,1:16:56.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（电报局）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.16,1:18:33.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（德国）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.64,1:18:37.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（斯德哥尔摩 赫尔辛基 莫斯科）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.45,1:18:46.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（荷兰）
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.89,1:18:48.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（海尔布隆）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.02,1:19:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当工业与武器联姻 这就是它们的产物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you get, Mr. Holmes, when industry marries arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.51,1:19:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now put your gun down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.67,1:19:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它已经过时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bit old-fashioned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.92,1:19:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该搞一把这种枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you need is one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.40,1:19:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.13,1:19:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.13,1:19:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,机关手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Machine pistol, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.97,1:19:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动连发\N{\fnArial\fs30}self-repeating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.42,1:19:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用了七点六三口径的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes 7.63 caliber rounds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.66,1:20:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,装在这里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.63,1:20:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷载十发子弹的盒式弹匣\N{\fnArial\fs30}A 10-shot box magazine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.03,1:20:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,装填十分方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy enough to load.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.84,1:20:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计要拉一下枪栓才能让子弹上膛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd imagine one would have to retract the bolt to engage the first round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.72,1:20:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,比说得还简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easier done than said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.50,1:20:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他送去手术室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him to the surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.22,1:20:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去把医生找来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'II find the doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.88,1:20:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果方便的话请来一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Come at once if convenient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.44,1:20:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不方便 也请来一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If inconvenient, come all the same."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.38,1:21:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是杜松子酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is schnapps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.62,1:21:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里发了个电报\N{\fnArial\fs30}A telegram was sent from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.03,1:21:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是杜松子酒 是阿夸维特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't schnapps, it's aquavit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.15,1:21:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从土豆泥里蒸馏出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}distilled from potato mash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.19,1:21:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,经常有人会弄错 不过还是谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A common misconception. Thank you, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.52,1:21:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,电报发给谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was it sent to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.60,1:21:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的罪行恐惧之至 就如同\N{\fnArial\fs30}My horror at your crimes is matched only…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.92,1:21:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你实施罪行时的技巧钦佩至极\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by my admiration at the skill it took to achieve them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.41,1:21:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,电报发给谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was it sent to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.17,1:21:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你利用无政府主义者和他们的炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used the anarchists and their bombs to create a crisis in Europe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.25,1:21:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在欧洲各国间制造了一个又一个危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nation against nation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.62,1:21:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用多个假名收买算计甚至\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under various pseudonyms, you bought, schemed, or murdered your way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.42,1:21:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过谋杀来渗透各行各业\N{\fnArial\fs30}…into numerous industries, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.06,1:21:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不留下与你有关的蛛丝马迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}assuring that none of it could be traced to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.47,1:21:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,棉花 鸦片 钢铁 以及军火和化学武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cotton, opium, steel, now arms and chemical weaponry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.63,1:21:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有东西一周之内就能运到欧洲各地\N{\fnArial\fs30}All to be shipped across Europe in less than a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.08,1:21:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,从子弹到绷带一应俱全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything from bullets to bandages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.16,1:21:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然已掌握了供给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that you own the supply, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.32,1:21:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就打算创造需求了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you intend to create the demand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.01,1:22:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场世界大战\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.49,1:22:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很熟悉舒伯特的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are familiar with Schubert's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.34,1:22:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住 别动
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.30,1:22:15.99,Title,0,0,0,0,,《鳟鱼》 可能是我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trout is perhaps my favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.67,1:22:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跪下
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.79,1:22:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个渔夫急于抓住一条狡猾的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fisherman grows weary of trying to catch an elusive fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.23,1:22:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让开 快让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out the way, out the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.32,1:22:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他搅浑河水\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he muddies the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.52,1:22:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm warning you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.52,1:22:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷惑了那条鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confuses the fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.21,1:22:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别耍花招
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.89,1:22:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告过你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were warned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.33,1:22:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等它发现自己进入陷阱的时候已经太迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't realize until too late that it has swum into a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.46,1:23:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 明亮的小溪里 有一条鳟鱼 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.39,1:23:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 它纵情欢乐 穿梭如箭 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.35,1:23:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我站在小溪旁 静静地观望 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.56,1:23:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在清澈的溪水里 它游得多欢畅 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.10,1:24:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再试一次 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try this again, shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.63,1:24:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那封电报你发给谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To whom did you send the telegram?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.11,1:24:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.81,1:24:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我的哥哥迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}To my brother Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.02,1:24:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是在玩什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you playing at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.90,1:25:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不公平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.71,1:25:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后还有一个问题要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just got one more question for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.96,1:25:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个谁是渔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of us is the fisherman…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.96,1:25:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是鳟鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and which the trout?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.48,1:25:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.85,1:25:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.17,1:25:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不着急 慢慢找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your time. Take your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.55,1:26:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你总是很高兴 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always good to see you, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.73,1:26:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想找死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you thinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.77,1:26:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.57,1:26:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.21,1:26:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你吧 我想我抓到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you must know, I was thinking I had him right where I wanted him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.86,1:26:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我想抓他的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.74,1:26:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Crack on, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.55,1:26:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.32,1:26:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right, I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.00,1:26:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别浪费时间来帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't waste time attending to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.16,1:26:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还愣着干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.60,1:26:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快追 追
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.85,1:27:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要抓住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'II find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.29,1:27:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要抓住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'II find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.42,1:27:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身倒数 三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn in three, two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.79,1:27:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hurry up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.00,1:27:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.52,1:27:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.73,1:27:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到我弟弟了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see my brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.69,1:27:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 但他肯定来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I'm certain he's been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.61,1:27:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该往哪儿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.58,1:27:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去围墙那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over that wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.70,1:27:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯 你怎么知道我找得到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know I'd find you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.34,1:27:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没在找我 你是在用塔楼砸我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't find me.You collapsed a building on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.92,1:28:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快点 赶快
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.48,1:28:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁他妈让你们把墙给轰了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.05,1:28:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are the horses?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.21,1:28:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.17,1:28:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.21,1:28:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna go back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.69,1:28:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,退路在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's our way out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.05,1:28:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,退路在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.82,1:28:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群蠢货
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.34,1:28:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁他妈让你们把墙给轰了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.86,1:28:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快给我追 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.70,1:28:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们跑了 快给我追
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.03,1:29:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快点 追
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.23,1:29:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让他们跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.36,1:29:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就等死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.80,1:29:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫击炮手准备
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.20,1:29:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开火 对准目标
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.28,1:30:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到小汉塞尔上场了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.26,1:30:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.58,1:31:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.98,1:32:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.02,1:32:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.90,1:32:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,马可 马可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marko! Marko!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.17,1:33:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有呼吸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not breathing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.06,1:33:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱住他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cradle his head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.62,1:33:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把脚抬起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise his legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.58,1:33:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你千万别给我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody well not gonna die on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.55,1:33:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会对你手下留情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna make this easy on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.30,1:33:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.94,1:33:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.98,1:33:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.35,1:33:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.75,1:34:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你听得见的 自私的畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can hear me, you selfish bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.63,1:34:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.12,1:34:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你听得见的 自私的畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can hear me, you bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.02,1:34:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的结婚礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wedding gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.53,1:34:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,噩梦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrible dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.61,1:34:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 玛丽 格莱斯顿和我在餐厅吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Mary, Gladstone and I were in a restaurant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.89,1:34:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只矮脚马也在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That satanic pony was there as well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.78,1:34:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹄子上拿了把大叉子想要吃了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}a massive fork in his hoof…and he turned on me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.30,1:35:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打了什么药\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you administered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.10,1:35:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的结婚礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wedding present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.27,1:35:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在我胸口上跳过舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's been dancing on my chest?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.71,1:35:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.91,1:35:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我脚踝那么痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is my ankle so itchy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.67,1:35:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有一大块的碎木片插在它上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a large piece of wood sticking out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.28,1:35:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪 嘿 塔马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Lord. You, Tamas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.64,1:35:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有件重要的事情要和你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an important job to discuss with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.64,1:35:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得等会儿提醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind me of it later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.64,1:35:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下 把这个喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down. Drink this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.77,1:35:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要在出现败血症前把它取出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get that out before it turns septic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.65,1:35:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是骂我自私的畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you call me "selfish bastard"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.42,1:35:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.78,1:35:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是别拔了 别拔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave it in. Leave it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.59,1:35:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这家伙简直是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a…Oh, you are some sort of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.75,1:35:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别惹我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.20,1:35:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾你没去成布莱顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry you didn't get to Brighton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.33,1:35:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.46,1:36:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.50,1:36:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I concur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.98,1:36:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.43,1:36:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺路去趟瑞士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Via Switzerland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.48,1:36:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,想挑起战争的最佳地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}What better place to start a war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.60,1:36:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是和平峰会\N{\fnArial\fs30}than a peace summit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.68,1:36:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正好去看我哥哥 他一定很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll drop in and see my brother. I'm sure he's missed you. Hm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.75,1:36:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不理解你为何不取消这次峰会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand why you don't cancel the summit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.23,1:36:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是无论我们怎么想它都会召开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fact is it's gonna happen whether we like it or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.00,1:36:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有政要都到齐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone has already arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.24,1:36:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些先生们或许在谈和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although these gentlemen may be talking peace…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.52,1:36:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 他们都做好了战争的准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}…believe me, they're readying their armies at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.16,1:37:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在取消峰会就等于宣告战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}To cancel the summit now would be tantamount to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.77,1:37:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那封电报还不够清楚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The telegram, wasn't it clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.13,1:37:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们增加了一倍的警力 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have doubled the security, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.21,1:37:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,双倍的警力 真叫人安心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, doubled security. That's comforting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.61,1:37:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白现在的情况有多微妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand the delicacy of the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.66,1:37:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把电报交给了我的上级 但他们就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I passed the telegram on to my superiors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.46,1:37:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始把莫里亚蒂拉来当和平顾问的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they brought Moriarty in to advise on the peace process in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.71,1:37:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在的身份很有优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has positioned himself brilliantly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.99,1:37:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我国最重要的智囊 又是现任首相的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of our foremost intellectuals, a personal friend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.35,1:37:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现任首相的私交好友 这个我们都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the prime minister. Yes, we all know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.79,1:37:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你 但你的证据在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you, but where's your evidence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.08,1:37:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他厉害到从不留下证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's too good to leave evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.08,1:37:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,办事滴水不漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't leave loose ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.24,1:37:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.21,1:37:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,歇利 快放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherly, put that down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.49,1:37:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个装置有什么用 给我好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this contraption? May I have it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.25,1:37:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸了以后真有点兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The effect is most invigorating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.05,1:37:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我私人专用的氧气储备 你不要乱碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my private and personal supply of oxygen, and you're not to touch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.74,1:37:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么讨论下去没有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}This argument is getting us nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.74,1:37:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备了一些文件让你们可以参加舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've arranged for documents to be prepared which allow you into the ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.87,1:37:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carruthers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.75,1:37:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯坦利 斯坦利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stanley, Stanley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.79,1:37:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点都没有变 这是我最爱的甜辣酱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't aged a day. Is that my favorite chutney?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.32,1:38:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 我们还没弄清楚他的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fact is, we don't really know what he's planning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.32,1:38:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会再用炸弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't be another bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.64,1:38:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不会用炸弹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it wouldn't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.01,1:38:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样做没有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.45,1:38:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击所有国家 只会令他们团结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he attack all the nations only to unite them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.29,1:38:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会有暗杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'l be an assassination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.13,1:38:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,被一个孤胆枪手近身刺杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}By a lone gunman at close range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.10,1:38:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,芮内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.94,1:38:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.62,1:38:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.79,1:38:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前只是怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had my suspicions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.15,1:38:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在看过出席名单后我就确定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But having seen who would be attending, I'm now certain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.35,1:38:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在起码知道该防着谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least we know who to look out for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.72,1:38:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,芮内就是证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rene will be the evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.00,1:38:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能找到他 阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can find him and stop him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.80,1:38:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能不止救了他的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will perhaps not only save his life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.96,1:38:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还避免了西方文明的崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but prevent the collapse of Western civilization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.89,1:38:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别有压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pressure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.83,1:39:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 大使先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, ambassador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.55,1:39:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·莫里亚蒂教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor James Moriarty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.53,1:39:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然大家都到了 我就告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're all present…I can tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.58,1:39:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,本次的主角是德国总理和他的大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the targets are the German chancellor and his ambassador…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.26,1:39:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有法国首相和他的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the French prime minister and his man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.94,1:39:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他国家实际上是来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other nations are really working out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.62,1:39:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,判断一旦开战应该站在哪一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}which side to take should hostilities erupt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.67,1:39:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是迈克尔王子 沙皇的表亲 和俄国大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince Michael, a cousin of the czar, and the Russian ambassador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.87,1:39:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,大公爵卡尔·路威格和奥匈帝国大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Archduke Karl Ludwig and the Austro-Hungarian ambassador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.60,1:39:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马尼亚首相和他的大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Romanian Prime Minister and his ambassador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.64,1:40:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 还有我们的首相和英国大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of course our prime minister and the British ambassador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.96,1:40:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该会选一个所有政要到齐的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hel choose a moment when the dignitaries are assembled, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.41,1:40:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是站着不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}preferably standing still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.29,1:40:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有安排拍集体照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there to be an official photograph?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.05,1:40:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.05,1:40:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有三十八分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 38 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.26,1:40:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然如此 我们不如跳个舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case, we might as well dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.35,1:40:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没跳过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never done this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.43,1:40:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我跳就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just follow my lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.53,1:40:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.73,1:40:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.03,1:40:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is my curse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.39,1:40:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你没看到你要找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't see what you're looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.81,1:41:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为你不会请我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd never ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.34,1:41:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我肩膀后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over my shoulder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.34,1:41:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人 穿德国制服 带仪式佩剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young man, German uniform, ceremonial sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.35,1:41:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.47,1:41:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么专业意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professional opinion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.23,1:41:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trauma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.24,1:41:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,受过重创\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.12,1:41:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但整形手术很成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}But excellent repair work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.04,1:41:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是霍芬斯塔大夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hoffmanstahl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.89,1:41:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过他是医学创新的开拓者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did say he was at the forefront of a medical innovation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.97,1:41:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们其实已经见过他的杰作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've already seen an example of his skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.86,1:41:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个人不是双胞胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those twins weren't twins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.30,1:41:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在海尔布隆时我产生了怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}My suspicions were aroused in Heilbronn…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.54,1:41:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个中枪倒地另一个却不帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when one failed to go to the aid of the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.23,1:42:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还注意到他耳后 有块隐蔽却独特的皱褶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also noticed the discreet but unmistakable puckering behind the ear…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.51,1:42:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的皮肤被拉过\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where his skin had been drawn back. I should've realized then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.35,1:42:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时就该意识到他们是手术的实验品\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that they were a surgical experiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.24,1:42:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,试验能不能让一个人长得就像另一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see if it is possible to make one man look like another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.72,1:42:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的脸已经不是他自己的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His face is no longer his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.05,1:42:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保世界大战发生的 最好办法就是让刺客\N{\fnArial\fs30}What better way to guarantee his world war than to make the assassin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.37,1:42:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为一名大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the ambassadors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.70,1:42:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就把范围缩小为六人中的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That narrows down the possibility to one of six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.42,1:42:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和西姆定能找出她弟弟 我毫不怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Sim shall find her brother.Of this I have no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.75,1:42:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.91,1:42:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my methods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.59,1:42:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道你要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know where youl be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.32,1:42:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我可以想到的最好的解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No possible solution could be more congenial to me than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.44,1:42:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 你跳舞是谁教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, who taught you how to dance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.45,1:42:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.13,1:42:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我教得还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've done a fine job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.33,1:42:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.38,1:43:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we go to work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.75,1:43:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 请集合拍照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, please, gather for the portrait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.76,1:43:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.72,1:43:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有打扰你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a bad time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.61,1:43:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,来得正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.09,1:44:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把钟拿来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you bring that clock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.18,1:44:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于有机会下棋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get to play that game after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.28,1:44:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,披上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.73,1:44:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不希望你感冒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't want you to catch a cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.78,1:44:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,下五分钟快棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}A five-minute game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.18,1:44:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你没问题就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think you can manage it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.33,1:45:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每人有两个象\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both have two bishops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.05,1:45:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我人虽然不在房间里 但我的战术还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may be absent from the room, but my methods are not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.29,1:45:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该不会指望华生大夫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't mean Dr. Watson, surely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.06,1:45:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不太公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't seem fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.51,1:45:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,手术会留下伤疤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. The surgery will have left scars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.63,1:45:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有四个人的鬓脚能够藏得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only four of them have the hairline to hide them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.60,1:45:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你用芮内掉包的大使 他还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ambassador that you replaced with Rene, is he still alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.73,1:45:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我提示你下一步棋怎么走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like me to recommend your next move?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.97,1:45:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,都和我弟弟差不多高.体形也一样.但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all my brother's height, right build…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.90,1:45:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but their eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.42,1:45:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,颜色不对 芮内是蓝眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their eyes are wrong. Rene has blue eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.91,1:45:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是带了能变色的玻璃镜片\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be wearing glass lenses to change the color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.11,1:45:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这样 眼睛应该会疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case, his eyes will be hurting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.56,1:46:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,芮内是左撇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rene is left-handed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.24,1:46:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许杀手会采取措施来避免暴露身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the assassin will take measures…to ensure he doesn't give himself away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.40,1:46:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像赌徒掩饰手上的牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a gambler concealing a tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.57,1:46:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉 可能是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it might be him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.78,1:46:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.06,1:46:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的钟还在走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your clock is ticking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.90,1:46:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可得肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to be sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.22,1:46:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提醒你 这可是快棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I remind you, this is blitz chess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.07,1:46:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次计算失误就会全盘皆输\N{\fnArial\fs30}A single miscalculation will cost you the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.19,1:46:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果把其他人摁倒在地 我就引发战争了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I tackle the wrong man to the ground, I could start a war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.64,1:46:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许没那么明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's less obvious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.20,1:46:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧张的跺脚 一阵焦虑的躁动\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nervous tic. A flutter of anxiety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.60,1:46:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想今晚每个人都会有他紧张的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect everyone has a reason to be nervous tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.29,1:46:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.99,1:47:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有可能恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}So perhaps it's the opposite:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.07,1:47:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有了自然表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}A failure to behave naturally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.39,1:47:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个演员太专注于他的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}An actor so consumed with his performance…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.87,1:47:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,以至于他唯一不能表现出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the one characteristic he cannot accommodate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.24,1:47:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是下意识反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is spontaneous reaction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.76,1:47:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.52,1:47:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.82,1:47:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,姐姐 原谅我
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.86,1:48:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗瑟 保护首相大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carruthers, protect the prime minister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.04,1:48:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国会付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Germany will pay! Mark my words!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.88,1:48:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎不太顺利 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't bode well, does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.52,1:48:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你的象多少有点作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems your bishop was of some benefit after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.41,1:48:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜负还不明朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game is still young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.77,1:48:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实胜负已经有定数了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's in its adolescence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.28,1:48:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more of us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.20,1:48:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国必须付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Germany will pay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.06,1:48:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不留后患\N{\fnArial\fs30}No loose ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.67,1:48:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.75,1:48:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个医生 是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a doctor. A doctor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.02,1:49:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.10,1:49:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是箭毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.02,1:49:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.18,1:49:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他中毒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's poison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.34,1:49:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.31,1:49:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.12,1:49:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人啊 我的天哪 快救救他
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.33,1:49:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你刚丢了最重要的棋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you've just lost your most valuable piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.14,1:50:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,制胜的策略有时候需要做出牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a winning strategy sometimes necessitates sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.38,1:50:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争被避免了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A war has been averted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.99,1:50:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. Oh, I disagree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.99,1:50:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.87,1:50:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得奇怪吗 你所发出的电报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you find it strange that the telegram you sent…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.32,1:50:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然没有给我带来任何的阻挠\N{\fnArial\fs30}…didn't inspire any action to stop me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.32,1:50:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 在潜意识的深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, hidden within the unconscious…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.81,1:50:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐藏着对冲突的无限渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is an insatiable desire for conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.93,1:50:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以与其说你反对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're not fighting me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.82,1:50:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如说是在反对人的天性\N{\fnArial\fs30}so much as you are the human condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.22,1:50:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要的无非是拥有子弹和绷带\N{\fnArial\fs30}AII I want to do is own the bullets and the bandages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.07,1:50:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,工业时代的战争是不可避免的\N{\fnArial\fs30}War on an industrial scale is inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.04,1:50:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要几年他们自己就会打起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theyl do it themselves within a few years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.56,1:50:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所要做的就是等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}AII I have to do is wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.13,1:50:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢瑞士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like Switzerland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.77,1:51:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们尊重个人的隐私\N{\fnArial\fs30}They respect a man's privacy here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.26,1:51:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是那些有钱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Particularly if he has a fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.91,1:51:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,象吃马 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bishop takes knight. Check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.15,1:51:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,棋已经下完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.76,1:51:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,去把肩伤治一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get that shoulder looked at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.12,1:51:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你那些财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}About that fortune of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.64,1:51:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕它已经明显地缩水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it's just been substantially reduced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.45,1:51:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,王向车两格\N{\fnArial\fs30}King to rook two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.85,1:51:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听过几次你的讲座\N{\fnArial\fs30}I attended several of your lectures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.37,1:51:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是运动公式 在我的书里也提到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The equations of motion, which you will find in my book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.66,1:51:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,释放这些爆炸所需要的能量就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The energy that is required to release these explosions is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.86,1:51:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在奥斯陆第一次看到你的小手册的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in Oslo when I first caught a glimpse of your little notebook…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.83,1:51:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德街斯迈森出品的红色皮面本\N{\fnArial\fs30}…red leather-bound from Smythson of Bond Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.35,1:51:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,车向王车移动三格 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rook to king's rook three. Check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.88,1:51:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,象向车三格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bishop to rook three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.29,1:52:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一开始不知道它的重要性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its importance was not fully apparent to me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.25,1:52:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我观察了你喂鸽子的小爱好\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until I observed your penchant for feeding pigeons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.73,1:52:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我想到经营如此庞大的产业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it occurred that with an empire so enormous…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.30,1:52:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是你也要做一点记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}…even you must keep a record of it somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.62,1:52:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,象吃象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bishop takes bishop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.94,1:52:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,车向象四格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rook to bishop four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.47,1:52:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来就是要弄到这手册\N{\fnArial\fs30}I then only required the notebook itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.79,1:52:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't make it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.47,1:52:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 您的外套 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.71,1:52:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿行李就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the bags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.24,1:52:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此我承受了相当的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would need to endure a considerable amount of pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.08,1:52:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.69,1:52:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王陛下的密探\N{\fnArial\fs30}care of Her Majesty's Secret Service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.41,1:52:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这本子上的内容无疑是加密的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the notebook would undoubtedly be encoded, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.69,1:52:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该如何破解呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}so how then to break the code?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.42,1:52:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,车吃车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rook takes rook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.58,1:52:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,兵吃车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pawn takes rook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.02,1:52:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,象向象七格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bishop to bishop seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.58,1:52:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,后 吃掉马和兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen takes knight pawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.26,1:52:50.55,Title,0,0,0,0,,那本《室内园艺的艺术》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does The Art of Domestic Horticulture{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.11,1:52:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}mean anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.63,1:52:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么像你这么细心的人有了这本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could a man as meticulous as you own such a book…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.11,1:52:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是窗台上的花却无人打理\N{\fnArial\fs30}…yet completely neglect the flowers in his own window box?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.24,1:53:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太荒谬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irony abounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.33,1:53:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 它很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind, it's safe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.81,1:53:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}in London…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.01,1:53:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我的同事正对其善加利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where my colleagues are making good use of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.81,1:53:13.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（室内园艺的艺术）
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.98,1:53:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧洲最不可一世的犯罪首脑的全部家产\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most formidable criminal mind in Europe has just had all his money stolen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.22,1:53:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚被伦敦警局史上最没用的督察给抄走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by perhaps the most inept inspector in the history of Scotland Yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.87,1:53:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我倒杯茶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance of a cup of tea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.43,1:53:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,0403号箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Box 0403.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.47,1:53:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.27,1:53:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,0801号箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Box 0801.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.31,1:53:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much more is there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.48,1:53:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二页结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the end of page two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.52,1:53:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三页\N{\fnArial\fs30}Page three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.89,1:53:43.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（当心你钓的鱼）
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.09,1:53:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会把钱匿名捐给 战争遗孀和孤儿基金会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be making an anonymous donation to the Widows and Orphans of War Fund.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.46,1:53:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,象向象八格 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bishop to bishop eight. Discover check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.78,1:53:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不巧的 死棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, incidentally, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.15,1:54:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肩膀好像受伤了 帮我一把好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to have injured my shoulder. Would you mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.00,1:54:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be my pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.91,1:54:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们这里的事情办完之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we've concluded our business here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.87,1:54:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我一定会\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's important you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.56,1:54:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到最有创意的方式来了结那个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I shall endeavor to find the most creative of endings for the doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.33,1:54:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.29,1:54:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的优势是我有伤在身\N{\fnArial\fs30}His advantage, my injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.62,1:54:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的优势是他急火攻心\N{\fnArial\fs30}My advantage, his rage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.14,1:54:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的攻击很鲁莽 却也很犀利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming assault feral, but experienced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.95,1:54:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用出拳间隙 予以反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use his momentum to counter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.32,1:55:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了 你真以为只有你会玩这一套吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come now. You really think you're the only one who can play this game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.56,1:55:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住手臂 攻击他的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trap arm. Target weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.01,1:55:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧接着重拳挥击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow with haymaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.69,1:55:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不愧是当年剑桥的拳击冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. There we find the boxing champion of Cambridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.06,1:55:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,反击有效 但容易看穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Competent, but predictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.74,1:55:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到我来回应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now allow me to reply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.23,1:55:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,火力难以为继 要调整策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arsenal running dry. Adjust strategy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.56,1:55:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤势的影响开始体现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wound taking its toll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.04,1:55:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如我担心的 肩伤让我无力防守\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I feared. Injury makes defense untenable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.53,1:55:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,预期结果 会越来越糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prognosis increasingly negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.50,1:55:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们别再浪费彼此的时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not waste any more of one another's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.99,1:55:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果我们心里都清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know how this ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.97,1:56:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,推理完毕 必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conclusion, inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.70,1:56:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.98,1:57:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,故事的尾声无需赘述\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few words may suffice to tell the little that remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.35,1:57:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何寻找尸体的努力都以失败而告终\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any attempt at finding the bodies was absolutely hopeless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.85,1:57:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.17,1:57:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,宏伟雄壮的漩涡和奔腾不息\N{\fnArial\fs30}…deep down in that dreadful caldron of swirling water{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.10,1:58:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,的浪花之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and seething foam…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.54,1:58:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,将永远长眠着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will lie for all time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.03,1:58:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个最危险的罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the most dangerous criminal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.23,1:58:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那个时代最伟大的正义先锋\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the foremost champion of the law of their generation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.84,1:58:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我心中他永远都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall ever regard him as the best…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.97,1:58:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过的最优秀最智慧的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the wisest man whom I have ever known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.34,1:58:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.34,1:58:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.14,1:58:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.31,1:58:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该收拾东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should probably pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.11,1:58:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在两点半 马车四点就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's half past 2…and the carriage is coming at 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.51,1:58:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.55,1:58:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在布莱顿度过美妙的一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a beautiful week in Brighton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.72,1:58:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it'll be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.20,1:58:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的非常期待\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking forward to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.77,1:58:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也非常想他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I miss him too…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.33,1:58:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in my own way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.06,1:59:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定不希望我们成行\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would have wanted us to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.26,1:59:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定想跟我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would have wanted to come with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.63,1:59:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森夫人几点来接格莱斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's Mrs. Hudson coming for Gladstone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.11,1:59:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.36,1:59:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,三点钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.17,1:59:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.21,1:59:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这包裹是谁送来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who delivered this parcel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.42,1:59:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,邮递员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The postman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.90,1:59:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前那一个还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The usual chap or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.38,2:00:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去有点诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}…did he look peculiar?{\r}
